  "description": "Ride Comfort, Seek New Paths\n\nMeet the Cyrusher Kommoda 3.0, our most comfortable and accessible step-through electric bike ever – redesigned for 2025 with a sleek look and upgraded performance.\nWhether you’re cruising around town or exploring new paths, the Kommoda 3.0 makes every ride smooth, stable, and fun.\n\nKey Highlights\n\nPowerful 750W Motor (85 N·m Torque) – Effortless climbing and instant acceleration for all terrains.\n\nSmart Torque Sensor – Enjoy a natural pedal feel with precise power delivery for a smoother, more efficient ride.\n\nDual Suspension Comfort – Front and rear shock absorption for ultimate ride comfort on roads or trails.\n\nLong-Range 48V 20Ah Battery – Ride up to 68 miles on a single charge for extended adventures.\n\nStep-Through Frame Design – Easy to mount and dismount for riders of all ages and abilities.\n\n20\" x 4.0\" Fat Tires – Confident traction and stability on pavement, gravel, or snow.\n\nBuilt for Comfort & Adventure\n\nFrom its upright riding position to its ergonomic handlebars and plush saddle, Kommoda 3.0 is designed to keep you comfortable mile after mile.\nAdd a rear rack basket or child seat to carry more and make it your go-to bike for family rides, daily errands, or weekend escapes.\n\nWhy Riders Love It\n\nTrusted by 200,000+ riders worldwide, Cyrusher e-bikes blend comfort, power, and freedom in every ride. The Kommoda 3.0 lets you explore further and ride with confidence every day.",
